This is actually a warning that you can ignore at the moment. It will go
away with the next release.

The issue stems from the function ap_log_rerror(), the underlying apache
function called from RApacheError, wanting a format string like "%s"
with additional arguments rather than a pre-formated or literal string.

Jeff

